('p-sf-02', '10 Pcs Lemon Scented Foot Odor Stickers for Shoes', '10-pcs-lemon-scented-foot-odor-stickers-for-shoes', 'MKZ-377016-377016001', 'Say goodbye to smelly shoes and socks with our Premium Quality odor remover patches. Perfect for Pakistani summers and daily wear, these stylish patches are your best bet for fresh feet without the hassle. Ideal for office, school, or Eid celebrations, they keep your footwear smelling clean and comfortable.

